  "mailer_subjects_invite": "Seu acesso ao painel da NZ Group",
  "mailer_templates_invite_content": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f7;padding:24px\"><div style=\"max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e5e8\"><div style=\"background:#0a0a0c;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px\">NZ GROUP</span></div><div style=\"padding:24px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:19px;color:#111\">Voce foi convidado para o painel da NZ</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#444\">Ola. Voce tem usuario no NZERP, entao ganhou acesso administrativo ao site <strong>nzgroup.com.br</strong>. Clique no botao para definir a sua senha de acesso ao site (a do ERP nao serve aqui).</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px\"><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#d92d20;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px\">Definir minha senha</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;color:#777\">O link vale 24 horas. Se nao abrir, copie e cole no navegador:</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:12px;color:#999;word-break:break-all\">{{ .ConfirmationURL }}</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#777\">Se voce nao esperava este e-mail, pode ignorar.</p></div><div style=\"padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid #eee;font-size:12px;color:#999\">NZ Group &middot; nzgroup.com.br &middot; WhatsApp +55 11 91890-7565</div></div></div>",
  "mailer_subjects_recovery": "Redefinir sua senha na NZ Group",
  "mailer_templates_recovery_content": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f7;padding:24px\"><div style=\"max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e5e8\"><div style=\"background:#0a0a0c;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px\">NZ GROUP</span></div><div style=\"padding:24px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:19px;color:#111\">Redefinir sua senha</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#444\">Recebemos um pedido para trocar a senha da conta <strong>{{ .Email }}</strong>. Clique no botao para escolher uma nova.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px\"><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#d92d20;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px\">Escolher nova senha</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;color:#777\">O link vale 1 hora. Se nao abrir, copie e cole no navegador:</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:12px;color:#999;word-break:break-all\">{{ .ConfirmationURL }}</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#777\">Se nao foi voce, ignore este e-mail: nada muda e a senha atual continua valendo.</p></div><div style=\"padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid #eee;font-size:12px;color:#999\">NZ Group &middot; nzgroup.com.br &middot; WhatsApp +55 11 91890-7565</div></div></div>",
  "mailer_subjects_email_change": "Confirme seu novo e-mail na NZ Group",
  "mailer_templates_email_change_content": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f7;padding:24px\"><div style=\"max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e5e8\"><div style=\"background:#0a0a0c;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px\">NZ GROUP</span></div><div style=\"padding:24px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:19px;color:#111\">Confirme seu novo e-mail</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#444\">Voce pediu para trocar o e-mail da sua conta NZ de <strong>{{ .Email }}</strong> para <strong>{{ .NewEmail }}</strong>. Confirme para concluir.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px\"><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#d92d20;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px\">Confirmar novo e-mail</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:12px;color:#999;word-break:break-all\">{{ .ConfirmationURL }}</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#777\">Se nao foi voce, ignore este e-mail.</p></div><div style=\"padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid #eee;font-size:12px;color:#999\">NZ Group &middot; nzgroup.com.br &middot; WhatsApp +55 11 91890-7565</div></div></div>",
  "mailer_subjects_magic_link": "Seu link de acesso a NZ Group",
  "mailer_templates_magic_link_content": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f7;padding:24px\"><div style=\"max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e5e8\"><div style=\"background:#0a0a0c;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px\">NZ GROUP</span></div><div style=\"padding:24px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:19px;color:#111\">Seu link de acesso</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#444\">Clique para entrar na sua conta NZ. O link vale 1 hora e so pode ser usado uma vez.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px\"><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#d92d20;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px\">Entrar na minha conta</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:12px;color:#999;word-break:break-all\">{{ .ConfirmationURL }}</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#777\">Se nao foi voce, ignore este e-mail.</p></div><div style=\"padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid #eee;font-size:12px;color:#999\">NZ Group &middot; nzgroup.com.br &middot; WhatsApp +55 11 91890-7565</div></div></div>",
  "mailer_subjects_confirmation": "Confirme seu e-mail na NZ Group",
  "mailer_templates_confirmation_content": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f7;padding:24px\"><div style=\"max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #e5e5e8\"><div style=\"background:#0a0a0c;padding:20px 24px\"><span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px\">NZ GROUP</span></div><div style=\"padding:24px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:19px;color:#111\">Bem-vindo a NZ Group</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#444\">Confirme seu e-mail para ativar a conta e ver os precos na loja.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px\"><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#d92d20;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px\">Confirmar meu e-mail</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:12px;color:#999;word-break:break-all\">{{ .ConfirmationURL }}</p></div><div style=\"padding:16px 24px;border-top:1px solid #eee;font-size:12px;color:#999\">NZ Group &middot; nzgroup.com.br &middot; WhatsApp +55 11 91890-7565</div></div></div>"
